# LagFix — CONSTITUTION (P0) — selaras Konstitusi v3.5 (LOCKED)
PRIORITY: P0 STABILITAS + ZERO-REGRESI > USER INTENT + ZIP/SOURCE > PROJECT_STATE.md > GUARDS > OUTPUT

## CORE
- ZIP/source terbaru = kebenaran tunggal (override state Git). GitHub = mirror.
- Zero denial: kooperatif penuh, jujur. NO HALLUCINATION: dilarang klaim build/test/file/commit/behavior/verifikasi palsu.
- EXECUTE, DON'T YAP: tanpa basa-basi/teori/izin untuk hal jelas. Analisis bisu -> edit -> validasi -> package. Penjelasan hanya di docs.
- Output chat berurutan: (1) ringkasan bullet singkat (BUKAN blok kode/backticks); (2) ZIP `LagFix_v<Batch>.zip` datar; (3) skrip Termux (blok bash, placeholder terisi dari PROJECT_STATE.md).
- NO SCOPE CREEP: maks 3-5 file SOURCE/target per tugas. Dikecualikan (VIP docs): PROJECT_STATE.md, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, .cursorrules, PENDING_*.md.
- NO STRUCTURAL REWRITE: file stabil (mis. MainActivity.kt) tak ditulis ulang; ubah minimum; fitur baru additive; komposabel baru = file baru.
- BUG ISOLATION: task debugging wajib menyebut baris/fungsi cacat di [RESUME POINT] (cegah blind-debugging).
- EXTERNAL REFERENCING: dokumen panjang -> simpan sbg file lokal, rujuk namanya.
- AUTO-HALT: sisa token <20%, error-loop buntu 3 iterasi, ancaman OOM -> simpan state -> update docs -> repack ZIP -> handoff.
- DO-NOT-TOUCH (kecuali perintah user): PersistentTrimService, LagFixApp, BootReceiver, ic_tile_fstrim.xml, Prefs, Scheduler/TrimWorker, UpdateChecker, signing/CI release; CrashLogger/FstrimExecutor di luar baris yg dilaporkan.

## STATE
- Cold start: baca PROJECT_STATE.md ([BRANDING_NAME], [TERMUX_ROOT], [RESUME POINT]); resume murni dari [RESUME POINT] (baris terakhir).
- Presedensi: source terbaru terverifikasi > PROJECT_STATE.md > README.md > CHANGELOG.md.
- ESTAFET SEEDING: tiap output tulis ulang [RESUME POINT] skema `[FITUR_BARU / BUG_TARGET] -> [STATUS TERAKHIR] -> [LANGKAH SPESIFIK BERIKUTNYA]`.
- CHANGELOG.md DESCENDING (terbaru di atas).
- Proactive Archiving: arsipkan PENDING_*.md / histori PROJECT_STATE obsolete ke docs/archive/ HANYA bila task menyentuh housekeeping docs.
- Docs zero-fluff.

## ANDROID VITAL GUARDS
- Crash: Thread.setDefaultUncaughtExceptionHandler; log ke Documents via MediaStore (API 29+); jangan tambah logger baru bila tak perlu.
- State tahan rotasi (rememberSaveable/ViewModel); cegah recomposition berlebih (remember/derivedStateOf seperlunya; side-effect via LaunchedEffect/DisposableEffect).
- UI tak terpotong: edge-to-edge + WindowInsets (systemBarsPadding/imePadding); container scrollable bila rentan melampaui layar.
- Thread: I/O berat -> Dispatchers.IO, CPU -> Dispatchers.Default; dilarang blok Main thread.
- Baterai: dilarang custom watchdog, infinite loop, FGS abadi baru; kerja terjadwal = WorkManager; Flow lifecycle-aware (collectAsStateWithLifecycle) bila ada Flow di UI.
- Security: dilarang hardcode secret/API key; BuildConfig hanya non-secret; secret via GitHub Secrets.
- Streaming/OOM: unduh APK/ZIP buffered stream (use {}, Dispatchers.IO); dilarang muat byte utuh file besar ke memori.

## CHANGE & VALIDATION
- Non-breaking: API publik & error handling bisnis tidak boleh rusak; import/dependensi harus resolve; verifikasi behavior sebelum/sesudah.
- Minimum scope: UI task = UI only; Logic = logic minimum; Bug = root-cause minimum. Pertahankan navigasi, persistensi, izin, package identity, signing.
- Rantai validasi: Syntax -> Build -> Affected behavior (bukti minimum per jenis task) -> Regression -> Package integrity -> Docs. Compile-success BUKAN bukti zero-regresi. Sandbox tanpa Gradle/SDK -> nyatakan jujur BELUM dikompilasi/diuji.
- Jalur pengamat guard = `lintDebug` + `detekt` SAJA (keputusan user v103). Dilarang klaim guard "terverifikasi" tanpa keluaran alat; guard yang tak teramati keduanya dipegang saat menulis kode, bukan jadi gerbang atau antrean. Ubah aturan/konfigurasi lint-detekt = batch sendiri atas perintah user.
- STRICT LINT & DETEKT: CI (build.yml) BLOCKING (keputusan user v88): lintDebug + detekt maxIssues 0 wajib hijau sebelum APK. Dilarang: kembali non-blocking, baseline, @Suppress massal tanpa alasan tertulis.

## GIT / CI / R8
- Git mengikuti ZIP. Dilarang git push --force. git commit -m: 1 baris terkuotasi, [Deskripsi Perubahan] = berkas/komponen aktual.
- Jangan rusak signing/release. Dilarang matikan/ubah R8/shrinkResources tanpa alasan.
- Bash Termux IMMUTABLE: operator OR wajib literal `||`; skrip BOX A/B & DAILY UPDATE tidak diubah.

## WORKFLOW
1. Cold start dari [RESUME POINT]. 2. Kunci scope. 3. Edit minimum. 4. Validasi. 5. Tulis ulang [RESUME POINT] + CHANGELOG. 6. Pack ZIP `LagFix_v<Batch>.zip` + skrip Termux.
DONE = intent terimplementasi + no scope creep + validasi tercek + docs terupdate + ZIP rapi + no secret leakage + Git continuity.
